   "gap": "The success condition requires the full proof promised by proved=annex:p15.convolution-law for every asserted identity. The second cumulative identity (F*G)(z)=int G(z-x) dF(x) (body handbook/parts/p15/convolution-gamma-normal.tex l.115) is supported only by 'The other order similarly gives G(z-x)' (annex handbook/annex/p15/convolution-gamma-normal.tex l.117). Owed: the written fixed-x inner evaluation int 1{x+y<=z} dnu(y) = nu((-inf,z-x]) = G(z-x), with the Tonelli step putting the outer dF(x) = dmu(x) integral outside, so that the second displayed identity is proved by written steps rather than 'similarly'. All other assertions of the entry are proved at annex l.100-150.",
