   "gap": "The success condition requires the full proof promised by proved=annex:p15.beta-gamma-convolution. The source rescaling identity int_0^z (z-y)^(alpha-1) y^(beta-1) dy = z^(alpha+beta-1) B(beta,alpha) (body l.256-260), on which both gamma-sum routes depend, is supplied only by 'The change y=zu, z>0, similarly gives the exact source rescaling identity' (annex l.307) followed by the displayed outcome (annex l.309-316). Owed: the written substitution y=zu applying thm:p15-affine-lebesgue with c=z (measure-scaling factor z; the held Durrett p.51 writes dy = x du), the rewriting (z-zu)^(alpha-1)(zu)^(beta-1) = z^(alpha-1)(1-u)^(alpha-1) z^(beta-1) u^(beta-1), and the exponent bookkeeping z * z^(alpha-1) * z^(beta-1) = z^(alpha+beta-1) on (0,1) with zero endpoint values. All other assertions are argued at annex l.296-400.",
